  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác cân, mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác đều.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> là sai vì hai vécto này đối nhau.</li><li>Khẳng định có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> cặp vectơ bằng nhau.</li><li>Áp dụng định lý côsin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>120</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mn>120</mn><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/e7fc0514ae15c034c5fe270ce36b0d5a53d3887a35905dd7bfc058bf243bd95e.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
